# No Tesla runtime credential belongs in this file. Reuse the existing OneCLI
# vault secret "Tessie API token" for api.tessie.com. Manage or revoke it at
# https://dash.tessie.com/settings/api. The host broker owns vehicle/chat checks
# and provider requests; agent scripts use IPC only.
# See docs/setup.md for default-disabled host provisioning and acceptance.

# GitHub Actions publication secret, configured in repository settings only:
# https://github.com/jbaruch/nanoclaw-tesla/settings/secrets/actions
# TESSL_TOKEN authenticates the canonical fleet publish workflow.
# The owner enrolls the repo in the existing central review GitHub App;
# do not create a new PAT or copy review credentials into a runtime .env.
